    "ty\":\"1457612\",\"preview\":\"Part Number:  THS4551   Tool/software:   Hello,\u00a0  I am designing\u00a0interface of single-ended source (ADXL354 accelerometer, with output impedance of 32kOhms) to delta sigma ADC model of ADS1288.  Since \",\"url\":\"https://e2e.ti.com/f/1/t/1457612\"},{\"faqFlag\":false,\"description\":\"THS4551: SPICE models\",\"entity\":\"945617\",\"preview\":\"Part Number:   THS4551  I was trying to import PSpice model to use with a commercial simulator and after two hours of wasted time I gave up.  If I don't resolve this soon, I will use a competitor chip\",\"url\":\"https://e2e.ti.com/f/1/t/945617\"},{\"faqFlag\":false,\"description\":\"OPA991: OPA991 is not meeting its slew rate specification.\",\"entity\":\"999779\",\"preview\":\"Part Number:   OPA991  I have been using the LM7301IM5 op-amp and switched over to the OPA991 as your web site suggested as a better part. In the same circuit, the 7301 meets its slew rate spec of 1.2\",\"url\":\"https://e2e.ti.com/f/1/t/999779\"}]</script>\n            </ti-e2e-support-forums>"
